                                                "sense_id": "c24ed522-66f1-3737-b024-ca9a329d7933",
                                                "text": "Sneeze is well known by all followers of U. of D. athletics for his great work at halfback on the Flyers' eleven for the past four seasons [...]"
                                            }
                                        ]
                                    },
                                    {
                                        "sense_id": "77a8f228-b283-39f4-98e6-0fbf510d25c4",
